## Interface: 11509, 16001
## Title: Super Social
## Notes: Mass whisper and quick reply for WoW Classic 1.15.x and WoW Forever 1.60.x.
## Author: miyanko
## Version: 4.1.0
## IconTexture: 134149
## SavedVariables: SuperSocialDB

# One toc for both clients. A second, flavour-suffixed toc would duplicate this file list for nothing:
# no code branches on which toc loaded, every client difference is detected at runtime in Core/Compat.lua,
# and a duplicated list only invites the two copies to drift apart.
# Load order is the dependency order: Core exports ns.* before Commands and UI read it.

Core\Compat.lua
Core\Names.lua
Core\Format.lua
Core\Lists.lua
Core\Group.lua
Core\Flags.lua
Core\Queue.lua
Commands\Whisper.lua
Commands\Reply.lua
Commands\Admin.lua
UI\Help.lua
